==Miscellaneous==
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**25,300 grants +5 Super Rare Catseyes.
**25,400 grants +5 Uber Rare Catseyes.
**25,500 grants +5 Legend Rare Catseyes.
*Added the [[Sonic the Hedgehog Collaboration Event]] content from [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]] to international versions.
*Added the [[Horde of Cats]] content from BCJP [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]] to international versions.
*Renamed [[Tasmanian Giant Crab (Enemy)|Crab]] (カニ, ''Kani'', Crab) to Tasmanian Giant Crab (タスマニアオオガニ, ''Tasumaniaōgani'', Tasmanian Giant Crab).
*Raised [[Ancient Egg: N206 (Special Cat)|Ancient Egg: N206]], [[Sardine (Special Cat)|Sardine]] and [[Squid (Special Cat)|Squid]]'s + level caps from +10 to +20.
*Added 6 new [[Talent Orbs|Ability Orb]] types:
**'''Cat Cannon Charge''' (にゃんこ砲チャージ ''Nyanko-hō Chāji''): Every second unit deployed skips 0.1~0.5 seconds <sub>3f~15f</sub> of the [[Cat Cannon]]'s recharge upon death. When two are equipped by the same unit, only one will take effect; the higher-Ranked Orb has priority.
**'''Resist Toxic''' (毒撃ダメージ耐性 ''Dokugeki Damēji Taisei''): Reduces damage received from Toxic attacks by 5-50%. Becomes immunity with either two S-Rank Resist Toxic Orbs or one S-Rank Resist Toxic Orb and a level 10 Resist Toxic [[Talents|Talent]].
**'''Dodge Attack (All)''' (全攻撃無効 ''Zen Kōgeki Mukō''): Every second unit deployed has a 1-10% chance to dodge attacks for 1 second. This works against all enemies, including non-standard types like [[:Category:Typeless Enemies|Typeless]], [[:Category:Witch Enemies|Witch]] and [[:Category:EVA Angel Enemies|EVA Angel]]. Units with pre-existing Dodge Attack abilities will have both theirs and the Orb's. When two are equipped by the same unit, only one will take effect; the higher-Ranked Orb has priority.
**'''Resist Slow''' (動きを遅くする耐性 ''Ugoki o Osoku Suru Taisei''): Reduces the duration of slow effects by 5-50%. Can stack with another Resist Slow Orb or Resist Slow Talents to become immunity.
**'''Resist Curse''' (古代の呪い耐性 ''Kodai no Noroi Taisei''): Reduces the duration of curse effects by 5-50%. Can stack with another Resist Curse Orb or Resist Curse Talents to become immunity.
**'''Boost Uncanny Legends''' (真レジェンドストーリー強化, ''Shin Rejendo Sutōrī Kyōka''): Increases health and attack power by 5-50% in [[Uncanny Legends]]. When two are equipped by the same unit, only one will take effect; the higher-Ranked Orb has priority.
*Moved the [[Upgrade Menu|Upgrade]] and [[Cat Combo|CatCombo]] List buttons in the Equip Menu slightly farther right and closer together.
*Added a button for the Auto-Equip function (自動編成機能, ''Jidō Hensei Kinō'', '''Automatic Formation Function'''), which appears in the Equip Menu when accessed from the stage selection screen. This button generates a random lineup that may be suited to the stage being viewed, taking the enemies' traits and some of their abilities ([[Wave Attack]]/[[Surge Attack]]/[[Explosion]]) into account.
**Auto-Equip cannot be used unless the stage has been played for long enough to reveal the enemies in the "Enemies Appearing" window. Since enemies are revealed automatically in [[Legend Quest]] and [[Underground Labyrinth]], playing the stages is not a requirement to use it there.
**Units can be pinned so they won't be swapped out when using this feature.
**This feature fully replaces Underground Labyrinth's random lineup feature.
*Implemented a new type of [[Enigma Stages|Enigma]], Illusory Maps.
*The [[Cat Food]] button now has the item's name labeled under the icon.
*Reworded the descriptions of several Cats with [[Immune to Waves]] or [[Wave Shield]] to accurately reflect the abilities' names.

